{"type":"assistant","uuid":"bc01e102-abd4-46e1-bcfb-f420f02a2cba","session_id":"7ca7d698-8367-41ef-b673-54f1f5b87e6f","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"bc01e102-abd4-46e1-bcfb-f420f02a2cba","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix has been applied. Here's a summary:\n\n## Bug Analysis & Fix Summary\n\n**Bug:** Screen rotate while previewing cards causes the preview to revert to the first card.\n\n**Root Cause:** In `Previewer.java`, the state variables `mCardList`, `mIndex`, and `mShowingAnswer` were only read from Intent extras in `onCreate()`, but were never saved via `onSaveInstanceState()`. When the screen rotates and Android recreates the Activity (particularly in scenarios where the Activity is killed by the system and needs to be restored), the state could be lost because `savedInstanceState` was never checked or populated.\n\n**Fix:** Two changes to `Previewer.java`:\n\n1. **Modified `onCreate()`** — Added a `savedInstanceState != null` check to restore `mCardList`, `mIndex`, and `mShowingAnswer` from the saved state bundle when the Activity is being recreated (e.g., after screen rotation). Falls back to reading from Intent extras only on initial creation.\n\n2. **Added `onSaveInstanceState()`** — Overrides the method to save `mCardList`, `mIndex`, and `mShowingAnswer` into the Bundle before the Activity is paused/destroyed, ensuring state survives configuration changes.\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- `AnkiDroid/src/main/java/com/ichi2/anki/Previewer.java`\n\n**Patch:** Saved to `fix.patch` in the workspace.\n\n**Note:** The project build (`./gradlew clean assembleDebug`) could not complete due to missing network access for the Android Gradle Plugin 3.5.3 dependency. However, the fix follows standard Android patterns for state preservation during configuration changes (matching the same approach used by `CardBrowser`, `DeckPicker`, and `NoteEditor` in the same codebase), so it should compile and work correctly."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":65302,"output_tokens":434,"cache_read_input_tokens":64416,"total_tokens":65736}}}
